        "calls": 1,
        "text": "Freebuff now records detailed, fixed reasons for why requests get blocked, such as when a model is unavailable or a payment is required, so support and data teams can see exactly what happened instead of just a generic error. For website publishing, the system now logs specific, stable codes for why a deployment failed, distinguishing between issues like network problems or build errors. Additionally, the shared data system has been updated to recognize events coming from mobile phone apps, ensuring that activity from those devices is tracked accurately alongside desktop and web usage. These improvements are internal data refinements that help the team understand user behavior better, and they do not change how the application looks or behaves for you.",
